\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{The gasket weights reproduce earlier energies}
\date{2026-11-07}

\p{On the [gasket graph](fdip-00DP), the weight
#{\bigl(\frac{5}{3}\bigr)^n} is chosen so that
\ref{fdip-00DT} reproduces the earlier energy. The three
corners of a cell, and then the midpoints added at the next
level, are finite. The resistance metric of
\ref{fdip-00EI} can be formed from those energies before any
comparison with a triangle in the plane.}
